{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30664","headline":"早春题湖上顾氏新居二首 二 · 项斯","name":"早春题湖上顾氏新居二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门不当官道，行人到亦稀。\n故从餐後出，方至夜深归。\n开箧拣书卷，扫牀移褐衣。\n几时同买宅，相近有柴扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项斯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30664.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30664","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}